This is for 8277(G3HGU)/8277B(VENUS).
1.This repository keep binary images, bl1.bin and bl2.bin. Those are built in
arm-trusted-firmware.  Because of confidential policy, we don't release source
codes. Provides binary images to build fip image.
2. Under root, make menuconfig will generate "bootloader.conf"
If miss bootloader.conf, building bootloader will fail. 
You can cp bootloader.conf.sample to bootloader.conf and modify it by youself.
